### Upload profile picture
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/user/profile-picture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary123

------Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
------Boundary123--

### Driver creates a ride
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pickupLatitude": -33.8765,
  "pickupLongitude": 18.6302,
  "pickupAddress": "Bellville Campus",
  "destinationLatitude": -33.9249,
  "destinationLongitude": 18.4241,
  "destinationAddress": "Cape Town CBD",
  "availableSeats": 3
}

### Passenger requests to join ride 1
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/rides/1/request
Authorization: Bearer {{{{token}}}}

### Driver views requests
GET {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/rides/1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}

### Driver accepts that passenger
POST {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/rides/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerId": 2
}
### 3. Passenger browses available rides (should list both, soonest first)
GET {{Mova_HostAddress}}/api/rides/available
Authorization: Bearer {{{{token}}}}